GET https://web.cyanide-studio.com/ws/bb3/team/?name=[LBL] Elveland Yndians&key={{apiKey}}

### Get team matches
GET https://web.cyanide-studio.com/ws/bb3/teammatches/?team_id=736410bc-9b9f-11ee-a745-02000090a64f&key={{apiKey}}

